"""layers.1.mlp.down_proj:4119 - a hyphen detector for compound words.

It fires on a hyphen (or dash) that is glued to the word before it and starts a compound,
as in "high-precision", "six-episode", "two-dimensional", "naturally-occurring", "COVID-19",
